  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　ロトムを　くみあわせ\nターボが　できるようになった　だけでなく\nすいじょうも　はしれる　じてんしゃ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬 로토무와의 조합으로\n터보를 사용할 수 있을 뿐만 아니라\n물 위에서도 달릴 수 있는 자전거.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "和寶可夢洛托姆結合的自行車。\n不僅可以進行渦輪加速，\n還能在水上移動。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sous l’influence de Motisma, cette bicyclette permet\nnon seulement de mettre le turbo, mais également\nde se déplacer sur l’eau.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Fahrrad, in dem sich ein Rotom befindet. Es wurde\nnicht nur um den Rotom-Turbo erweitert, sondern kann\nsich jetzt auch auf dem Wasser fortbewegen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Combinada con el Pokémon Rotom, esta bicicleta te\npermite usar un turbo y también desplazarte por encima\ndel agua.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La presenza di Rotom non permette solo di usare\nil turbo, ma anche di correre sulla superficie dell’acqua.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This bike can be combined with the Pokémon Rotom to\nnot only do a turbo boost but also run on the water.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　ロトムを　組み合わせ\nターボが　できるようになった　だけでなく\n水上も　走れる　じてんしゃ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自行车和宝可梦洛托姆组合后，\n不仅可以通过涡轮发动机加速，\n而且可以在水面上骑行。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Combinada con el Pokémon Rotom, esta bicicleta te\npermite usar un turbo y también desplazarte por encima\ndel agua.",
